      "role": "user",
      "content": "that's a strong start. i like the part about silence being a vote for the status quo. can u expand on that part specifically? like, make it even more intense regarding how people who choose not to vote are actually failing their fellow citizens. i want to really drive home the idea that staying home isn't just \"not participating,\" it's actually a moral failing.",
